/*
  WidgetCatalogueDialog.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0026 · WidgetCatalogueDialog (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `WidgetCatalogueDialog`
  resolves (table "WidgetCatalogueDialog") lives here with its English value. The web source
  (features/dashboard/components/WidgetCatalogueDialog.tsx) routes its copy through
  `t('dashboard.catalogue…')` / `t('dashboard.added')`; the native surface mirrors those keys so no
  English literal lives in Swift. `{{token}}` placeholders match the web `t(key, fallback, { token })`
  interpolation. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration
  time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings.

  Groups: dialog chrome + states; the freshness chip + banners; the header subtitle + search + result
  count; the no-matches empty card; the entry add controls; and the 16 category labels (web
  `CATEGORY_FALLBACK_LABELS`).
*/

